    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samsoni sea huda leabu Dimna",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwararang'eesa Samsoni Dimna, ak ghwadaah gatmu aba Dimna, hudagi aba heeda haweega fuga Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabiikta ak gwayeesha ghwaan ea ghaamwat, “Naadaayi gatmooda aba Dimna, mida jeeda haweega fuga Filisti; agakuuneani daghi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha ghwaan ea ghaamwat, “Aba bugusta fuga iduupcheewi ghana gea eaduupcheewi manda gatmooda? Gili jea una gheana gatmooda fuga Filisti meeyiilean?” Gwayeesha Samsoni ghwaan; “Agooga agakuuneani niny, aba gideaba ghaabwariinyi muuchi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda ghwaan ea ghaamwat ea mii ghwanal gideaba ng'asheanji gaba NG'UTAMIIDA; aba gideaba gagasa ng'ooweata aba heeda fuga Filisti. Nea aba damandida fuga Filisti goombali Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwararang'eesa ghwaan ea ghaamwat Dimna, ak ghwahita jeeda madameega sabiibu bea Dimna; ak ging'ulayi ghwanya ghuuta ng'adiida mwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu headaanyi guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA aba uurda, ak gwahirjeawi gawuurji siida hirjeawi dayeenda mbooyda, nea geatingaaschi ea manda gil, ak hean ea marukusiina ghwaan ea ghaamwat gisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwararang'aada ak goobalool gatmoodida; ak ghwanung' ghang'weal Samsoni muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu gabiikta ghamwaghaada, ng'ata goong'weersa murdeadaanyi ak ghwadaah musta ng'adiida, ak ging'ulayi gwanda uudiga saang'a jeeda musta ng'adiida, sea maleeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwayiin maleeda geadi, ak gawa mwadi; nea ghwaagaada ea ghwahita heeda mida ghwaan ea ghaamwat, ng'ata ghoadaw ak ghwaak, nea ea marukusiina gideaba maleeni gwaleabu jeeda musta ng'adiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gawa ghwaan heeda gatmoodida; ak gwasin Samsoni ghweelmeeda aba hoowa, ghoah gida sina gheareemanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea geadaah, geeyeassa fugaaschi was diktam ea damanamughuush, gwandeayi sea niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Aniini gaydarukuneegwa ghwasiildeanga; inyas gajarukunean gidawas, aba jeedeaba eawooji ispwa bea ghweelmeedeani, ak ghoanali gida bea abeeda gaydagooneegwa hang'weaka miyaasiin hita diktam ea damanamughuush, ea hang'weaka suuk hita diktam ea damanamughuush; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba iyoaraanyi arukunean, abeeda gajagoonean hang'weaka diktam ea damanamughuush miyaasiin ea hang'weaka suuk.” Hean geeyeesha, “Heapi rukuni ghwasiildeangaagu, eayiinya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweeteaba ang'wan gwayeesha saawa gatmooda Samsoni, “Sapsabwa siyeadaang'u gwarukuneasa gida bea ghwasiildeanji, adiidu geejoonyeeyi beasta ang'iing'i ea ghaheang'wa. Googuurneasa hiji gideaba gajoareadeasa haleanjeedeanya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goorareang'u shooka gatmooda Samsoni aba madeadaanyi, ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i gistan, nea ea mibwaariinyan; ang'iing'i nibwar ghwasiildeanga sea fuga ghaheanya, nea ea mii rukuneani gida bea.” Hean gwayeesha niny, “Ng'ula, eara bwaabwa ea iyya miidarukusa, ak abeeda gaydarukuneey ang'iing'i?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooyeawusa eawooji ispwa bea ghweelmeeda nyaawa, ak eaweeteaba ispwa gwarukuta, aba gideaba goodeawiiti muuchi. Aba ng'ata gwarukusa fuga gheanyaawa gida bea ghwasiildeanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fuga mujiini niny eaweeteaba ispwa gheata miigamikta aseeta,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
